(7534504, 1205348, 163081, '<td valign="top">Cute little bunny, The processing is not suitable for this type of picture. I know that rabbits are not easy to take, but your shutter speed must be much higher, otherwise you will have some blurry parts in the picture (the eye could have been cleaned up, 3 light dots to only 1 would make it much better.) Interesting part is the lid you used to put the pieces of carrot in it. I give you a 6.</td>', 'Cute little bunny, The processing is not suitable for this type of picture. I know that rabbits are not easy to take, but your shutter speed must be much higher, otherwise you will have some blurry parts in the picture (the eye could have been cleaned up, 3 light dots to only 1 would make it much better.) Interesting part is the lid you used to put the pieces of carrot in it. I give you a 6.', '2017-09-11 11:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
