(7535175, 1205304, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine title, and it''s his pensiveness while walking the dogie, walking the line in this dry, beautifully empty country that fixes my appreciation.  I like the soft, unpretentious colors, the everyday serenity, the surrounding immensity.  Is the man too centered?  That his gaze is down gainsays self-importance, and is a counterbalance.  The diagonal angle of his motion also mitigates.  What''s on both his left and right is important and engaging.  This isn''t criticism, just addressing a thought.  The strength of the image certainly carries the artist''s judgement.<br/>My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Fine title, and it''s his pensiveness while walking the dogie, walking the line in this dry, beautifully empty country that fixes my appreciation.  I like the soft, unpretentious colors, the everyday serenity, the surrounding immensity.  Is the man too centered?  That his gaze is down gainsays self-importance, and is a counterbalance.  The diagonal angle of his motion also mitigates.  What''s on both his left and right is important and engaging.  This isn''t criticism, just addressing a thought.  The strength of the image certainly carries the artist''s judgement.My favorite in this challenge.', '2017-09-15 14:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7535176, 1204984, 173844, '<td valign="top">Her expression, puckered lips and arched eyebrows, is at the heart of this fine image. Then her stance as she''s temporarily distracted from her work.  I also like how the simplicity of the right third of the scene is balanced by the complicated, busy left two thirds.  An offhand gem.</td>', 'Her expression, puckered lips and arched eyebrows, is at the heart of this fine image. Then her stance as she''s temporarily distracted from her work.  I also like how the simplicity of the right third of the scene is balanced by the complicated, busy left two thirds.  An offhand gem.', '2017-09-15 14:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7535179, 1205327, 173844, '<td valign="top">A black and white tour de force.  Not simple, but it seems splendidly so.  That''s artistry.  It''s moving.  Can''t add any more.<br/>I already declared a favorite, but it''ll have to share.</td>', 'A black and white tour de force.  Not simple, but it seems splendidly so.  That''s artistry.  It''s moving.  Can''t add any more.I already declared a favorite, but it''ll have to share.', '2017-09-15 14:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7535276, 1205217, 27735, '<td valign="top">Great shot, if this doesn''t get the blue I may never enter another challenge!</td>', 'Great shot, if this doesn''t get the blue I may never enter another challenge!', '2017-09-15 18:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
