(7535933, 1205319, 74588, '<td valign="top">what i did isthis.<br/>i spread a bes sheet that has black atripes on the floor.made a fish from carton and notted a long piece of sewin cotten around its nek<br/>while holding the camera above the sheet i pulled the fish at various speedsalong<br/>the results were a fast cry from what i expected<br/>just selected the the crazies one and send it in<br/>goes to show in every heap of doing something ,there is always the thing you need<br/>thank you all for the comments<br/>made my day</td>', 'what i did isthis.i spread a bes sheet that has black atripes on the floor.made a fish from carton and notted a long piece of sewin cotten around its nekwhile holding the camera above the sheet i pulled the fish at various speedsalongthe results were a fast cry from what i expectedjust selected the the crazies one and send it ingoes to show in every heap of doing something ,there is always the thing you needthank you all for the commentsmade my day', '2017-09-20 15:41:25.000000', NULL, 0),
